  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a8286b385e5f4db",
      "translationZh": "过去 3 年，AI 评估一直是我的工作重点。1 对于评估，我最常听到的反对意见是：“我们的产品很难评估。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e0670b27f9b3b00",
      "translationZh": "这种反对意见是产品存在问题的信号。对你来说难以验证的产出，对用户来说往往也很难验证。最糟糕的情况下，用户必须从头重做一遍，才能验证输出。更重要的是，在构建评估之前，你就应该先把产品设计得易于验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2e6d302451de343",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我会逐一介绍我曾提供咨询的三个产品，它们都遇到了这个问题。我还会展示改进前后的草图，以说明设计原则。在这些例子之后，我会讨论如何将这一通用模式应用到你的产品中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cb594ee078e82f14",
      "translationZh": "示例 1：AI 数据智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e532a90fe7ba69bb",
      "translationZh": "几乎每一家与我合作过的公司，都在构建内部 AI 数据智能体。你向它提出一个业务问题，比如 Product A 上个季度的净收入是多少，它就会找到相关数据源、运行查询并给出答案。这个智能体的目标是减少对数据分析师的依赖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17a7d7070e48d516",
      "translationZh": "构建 AI 数据智能体时，一个常见错误是只输出答案，如下所示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a7cffa4c73fad42",
      "translationZh": "Product A 上个季度的净收入是多少？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0779fb1a019fca81",
      "translationZh": "Product A 上个季度的净收入为 4.21M。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c21c3796ce889590",
      "translationZh": "关于你的业务，想问什么都可以…… ➤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "191de77dddeddc70",
      "translationZh": "由于唯一的输出就是答案，这里没有任何可供核查的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e10ffb74da4cdcc",
      "translationZh": "在上面的草图中，用户除了重新做一遍工作之外，没有办法验证答案。2 更好的设计是参考领域专家验证输出的方式，为用户提供可核查的产物。以下是我作为数据科学家验证指标时使用的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b3c983bfd0895f40",
      "translationZh": "将数值及任何中间计算结果与可信来源进行比较，例如经过审核的仪表板或报告，或同事已经审核过的类似分析。3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ac8875f1138160a",
      "translationZh": "准确确认指标的定义。像净收入这样的数值，可能包含或不包含退货和折扣等项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "490b7caf1a980121",
      "translationZh": "对相关数值进行合理性检查。如果我无法直接验证这个数字，就会调取一个应该与它联动的相关数字，例如售出件数或去重客户数，然后检查两者的组合是否合理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1913d98186e27fad",
      "translationZh": "查看汇总值之下的明细。总数可能掩盖问题，因此我会按地区或时间段等维度将其拆分，并检查分布是否合理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb5bf419cf24178d",
      "translationZh": "阅读查询语句。对于重要的数字，我会查看 SQL，确认它执行的操作符合我的理解，并对其进行调整、重新运行，以检验我的假设。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb655877e574eeff",
      "translationZh": "注明所有我无法核实的内容。如果某个步骤没有可信的参考资料可供核对，我会将其标记出来，而不是把它当作定论呈现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca7b933c99111374",
      "translationZh": "更好的界面可能是这样的。下方的两个标签页以两种详略程度展示同一个答案。聊天回复会优先呈现值得关注的细节，而笔记本则保存答案背后的完整分析。使用标签页即可在两者之间切换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc8a86b63d1044c1",
      "translationZh": "改编自 Priya Nair 撰写的《季度收入回顾》· 2026 年 6 月 28 日 打开 ↗",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02023da5c385fd4e",
      "translationZh": "指标定义 总额 − 退货 − 折扣 与受治理的定义一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "997eba8eb35195e6",
      "translationZh": "中间计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37cc465d7da2a36e",
      "translationZh": "已扣除退货 −0.7M 无可信来源 ⓘ",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43e07347403be526",
      "translationZh": "去重客户数 12,480 183 未匹配 ⓘ，CRM ↔ Billing",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d913ab1e52c994b0",
      "translationZh": "智能体会呈现答案背后的重要细节。选择上方的笔记本标签页，即可查看智能体生成的完整分析。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2930c093540982ed",
      "translationZh": "这是智能体在生成答案时使用的笔记本。在图中滚动可查看所有单元格。侧边栏有“目录”选项卡，可用于跳转至不同章节，还有“助手”选项卡，可用于继续提问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8e30e9f72b2e366",
      "translationZh": "net_revenue_product_a .ipynb ▶ 全部运行 ↑ 发布",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84d11f0aadcb5a31",
      "translationZh": "◫ 改编自《季度收入回顾》↗，作者：Priya Nair · 2026年6月28日",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c900cbb1237764ae",
      "translationZh": "净收入 — 产品 A，FY25 第四季度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "877be2f308aa8948",
      "translationZh": "简短回答：4.21M。本笔记本展示了这一数字的计算过程，以及对照可信来源核查了哪些内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91753446f29558a9",
      "translationZh": "净收入等于总收入 − 退货金额 − 折扣金额。从受治理的指标层读取定义，以确保这一口径与财务报告一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a38b732bdeb7a0f3",
      "translationZh": "Python ▶ 代码已折叠 ✦ 询问 AI ⌘K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "853d14c60a21d3e8",
      "translationZh": "2. Product A 的净收入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30446aa1d431fc36",
      "translationZh": "直接从订单明细行中提取 Product A 本季度的净收入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "819a076b7a381247",
      "translationZh": "SQL ▶ 代码已折叠 ✦ 询问 AI ⌘K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1841d68167e96058",
      "translationZh": "这就是聊天回答中报告的 4.21M。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "71a7beaa0b7b7013",
      "translationZh": "3. 检查分布是否合理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "255d982196c45a31",
      "translationZh": "按地区细分 Product A 的数据，然后绘图。与上季度的构成相比，应该没有任何看起来异常的地方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c051e5a1fde31f59",
      "translationZh": "按地区划分的净收入 · Q4 FY25",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "235c4e132dc77db5",
      "translationZh": "西部和中部贡献了大部分收入，国际地区仅占很小一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be486450ed0f102b",
      "translationZh": "4. 我无法核实的内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50c8a938cfc337c3",
      "translationZh": "有两项输入没有可信来源可供核对。我们没有将它们视为定论，而是在下方分别保留为可运行和编辑的单元格，供你深入探查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "35e293e945d57b4a",
      "translationZh": "Q4 退货数据尚未加载，因此 −0.7M 是估算值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ded88b82b3b1c6d",
      "translationZh": "所以，目前还没有来源可用于核对这个 −0.7M。另一项待解决的问题是客户关联：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d3caeef1a4a91be2",
      "translationZh": "183 行 · 61,540 未归属",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a46f727bef902264",
      "translationZh": "也就是说，有 61,540 的收入尚无法确定归属于哪个客户；将其明确呈现出来，是为了让人在信任总额之前先解决这个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57bc02220f4cfb9b",
      "translationZh": "我使用财务部门受治理的定义，从订单行项目中提取了 Product A 的净收入，按地区进行了细分，并标记了我无法核实的内容。单元格在左侧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5298cedbf75e4a2",
      "translationZh": "✓ 已在此笔记本中生成单元格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e344e6e23f865839",
      "translationZh": "这份笔记本从上到下依次呈现：智能体所做的假设、执行的查询，以及一份明确列出其无法验证事项的清单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d59505b39977bed",
      "translationZh": "这里有很多值得深入探讨的内容。以下是一些显著的变化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a934345c0fb55028",
      "translationZh": "智能体可以选择从经过审核的分析中检索内容，界面会显示使用了哪份分析，以及其作者是谁。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1237d555a0caed44",
      "translationZh": "细节采用渐进式披露。聊天回复会显示来源、假设和问题等高价值信息。用户可以选择打开交互式笔记本，查看完整上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af84674463b31b31",
      "translationZh": "AI 生成的笔记本（见上方的笔记本标签页）在组织方式上旨在方便验证：开头列出智能体所做的假设，例如指标的定义及其来源，然后展示执行的查询及其返回的数值。它会将总量拆解开来，让你可以检查分布是否合理，最后列出无法验证的事项，每一项都保留为一个可运行的单元格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26ac70efa0772c9c",
      "translationZh": "笔记本中也提供了 AI 智能体，帮助处理后续问题。最后，用户可以将笔记本发布回知识库，供未来的分析检索使用，从而形成良性循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8609a177febf78b7",
      "translationZh": "这个设计草案远非完美。关键在于，产品应该帮助用户像领域专家那样验证答案。可以将其与前面那种唯一输出就是一个数字的做法作比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "245eb9f9f8e942db",
      "translationZh": "这样的数据智能体并非科幻。Hex 4 是这类产品中我最喜欢的一款；在我见过的产品中，它将笔记本与聊天整合得最好。以下是其落地页的截图：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9eea7369efe5854b",
      "translationZh": "笔记本视图，让用户可以查看中间步骤和数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbb9a071b4a521a9",
      "translationZh": "但这与评估有什么关系呢？如果你在设计产品时就考虑到验证的需求，标注成本就会降低，评估也能从中获得更优质的信号。更重要的是，你将为用户提供更好的产品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b1c1c799d50a6fec",
      "translationZh": "示例 2：体育课程构建器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7120264c8adddb53",
      "translationZh": "我曾指导过的一位创始人正在开发一款 AI 工具，为 K-12 教师编写体育课教案。教师输入自己的限制条件，例如所教的年级、每节课的时长、在室内还是室外上课，以及有哪些器材。然后，该工具会根据这些限制条件编写教案。目标是为教师节省备课时间，并为他们提供适合其课堂的教案。下面是这款产品的界面草图：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "179b6dcaaac969fb",
      "translationZh": "课程时长 45 分钟 ▾",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "890614a739d07d43",
      "translationZh": "器材 12 个标志锥，6 个球",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b970c966f4b78d1",
      "translationZh": "球类技能 第 1 课，共 8 课 已生成的教案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65f4df365dd7a6de",
      "translationZh": "沿场地周边慢跑，然后进行动态拉伸：手臂绕环、弓步和高抬腿。最后与搭档互相抛接球，让双手热身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0dbe07aeea57f0f4",
      "translationZh": "将学生两人分组，并将标志锥相隔10英尺摆放。搭档先练习下手投掷，再练习上手投掷。提示他们用投掷手另一侧的脚向前迈步，并完成随挥动作。随着准确度提高，拉大间距，每5分钟更换一次搭档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a016cf886124a44e",
      "translationZh": "进行静态拉伸，并快速回顾投掷动作要领：迈步、指向目标、随挥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c816b457a19870f",
      "translationZh": "观察学生投掷时是否迈步、将投掷手另一侧的脚置于前方，并注视目标。记录下次课需要缩短投掷距离的学生。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb43e0176e83fcb9",
      "translationZh": "12个标志锥、6个泡沫球、3个练习站标志物。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bdf3796b9485a8b",
      "translationZh": "教师输入约束条件，工具从零开始编写教案。唯一的输出就是教案，因此很难核验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e95db21b284c968",
      "translationZh": "创始人问我该如何评估这些教案。我把问题反过来问：教师在意什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f86ed06ea7bcf82",
      "translationZh": "让教师信任一份教案，最快的方法是让他们看到，与自己情况相似的教师已经在使用它。此外，教师也重视了解其他人正在做什么，以便学习新的方法。因此，更好的设计或许应该以经过审核、且正在学校中实际使用的教案为起点。工具生成教案时，会展示它以哪份经过审核的教案为基础、谁在使用那份教案，以及为适应该教师的约束条件而做出的差异对照。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca17f896ff48ce40",
      "translationZh": "接下来，教师可以对照一份自己已经信任的教案，检查少量改动，而不必从头评判整份教案。下面是一幅草图，展示了更好的界面可能是什么样子：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2a4415df6dc5026",
      "translationZh": "DR 改编自 Dana Ruiz 的教案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49276aa3efd82668",
      "translationZh": "四年级体育课 · 得克萨斯州奥斯汀市林肯小学",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b6dd1e3fb6c8d29",
      "translationZh": "已在 14 所学校使用 今年已开展 30+ 次 符合 SHAPE 标准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a56d3fce324cdd26",
      "translationZh": "1 慢跑到远处的锥形标志桶再返回，跑完 1 圈，然后进行动态拉伸：手臂绕环、弓步和高抬腿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "535d7291aac84630",
      "translationZh": "最后与同伴互相抛接球，为手部热身，每人抛球 10 次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab57f5f5cbfc0c58",
      "translationZh": "2 设置 3 个练习站，以锥形标志桶为目标。两人一组，使用 6 个球，先练习下手投掷，再练习上手投掷，每 5 分钟轮换一次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "385d9cfe29f1394c",
      "translationZh": "提示学生用投掷手对侧的脚向前迈步，并朝目标方向完成随挥动作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f216dad30cd6a83",
      "translationZh": "随着准确性提高，增大同伴之间的距离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4c6d7d21789d8db",
      "translationZh": "进行静态拉伸，并回顾投掷动作要领：迈步、指向目标、随挥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ce3b77e0239fae2",
      "translationZh": "观察学生是否在投掷时迈出与投掷手相反一侧的脚，并注视目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cd2100a07c5f223",
      "translationZh": "记下哪些学生下节课需要缩短投掷距离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ebe09cbf20b7bb5",
      "translationZh": "更改内容 · 2 处编辑 全部接受 全部拒绝",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a9fda095ee89527",
      "translationZh": "− 慢跑 2 圈，然后进行动态拉伸（10 分钟）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c1ce1ca1ea3e68f",
      "translationZh": "慢跑 1 圈，然后进行动态拉伸（8 分钟）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dd79902e87f0077",
      "translationZh": "缩短时间，以适应 45 分钟的课时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e583b7804b311738",
      "translationZh": "− 4 个练习站点，8 个球，以圈环为目标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33cd213bc45c585e",
      "translationZh": "3 个练习站、6 个球，以标志锥作为目标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3246a56a6a1c703",
      "translationZh": "与你的器材相匹配",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6336c06542ae55c",
      "translationZh": "这份教案以另一位教师使用的、经过审核的教案为基础。改动都已标出，便于教师与自己信任的教案进行差异对比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec77ae368dcf59a9",
      "translationZh": "在这个版本中，教案的大部分内容沿用了经过审核的教案。教师的审核范围仅限于几处修改，每处都附有说明改动原因的理由。这种审核教案的方式更高效，因为它减轻了从头评判整份教案所带来的认知负荷。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f974d4a3409d4c0",
      "translationZh": "围绕这一点进行设计，会让产品更容易构建。工具不再把数百个示例塞进提示词，而是捕捉重要维度，检索出一个高度匹配的教案，再进行调整。自动化评估现在也变得切实可行，因为需要测试的范围更小了。例如，你可以验证教案检索是否选取了合理的基础教案，以及每处修改是否都遵守了约束条件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ec626995c2c203fe",
      "translationZh": "示例 3：工伤赔偿医疗报告",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f081ba76636daab3",
      "translationZh": "最后一个示例来自一款工伤赔偿工具，一位创始人曾请我协助开发。它会读取患者的病历（初诊登记表、影像报告、治疗记录、既往检查记录），并生成一份篇幅很长的专家意见报告，通常有五十页甚至更多。下面是这个产品的草图：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4767bcc5e15c9ff",
      "translationZh": "文件 编辑 案件 报告 视图 帮助",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3be9e1d0488eba41",
      "translationZh": "主治医师记录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0f229edac3c1f82",
      "translationZh": "索赔人 J. Doe 索赔编号 #WC-20259417 受伤日期 2025年3月3日 检查医师 A. Patel 医生",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cff22f9c3fad865",
      "translationZh": "独立医学评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ac16e9587a6b650",
      "translationZh": "永久且稳定状态报告",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a05324e351712997",
      "translationZh": "索赔人为一名47岁的仓库员工，据其陈述，他于2025年3月3日搬起一个估计重六十磅的纸箱时腰椎受伤。他描述，当时立即出现下背部疼痛，并向右下肢放射，随后小腿外侧出现麻木。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cc8bf35e4ab8e81",
      "translationZh": "审阅的记录包括初诊问卷、2025年3月18日的腰椎MRI、十二份物理治疗记录，以及主治医师截至2025年8月的病情进展报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94b73722711b3765",
      "translationZh": "检查时，腰椎前屈受限至40度，并伴有疼痛。右侧直腿抬高试验在50度时呈阳性。右侧拇长伸肌肌力为4/5级，L5神经分布区感觉减退。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7a0ed190fe6f6ca",
      "translationZh": "L5-S1节段腰椎间盘突出，伴右侧L5神经根病，上述影像学及体格检查结果支持该诊断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f43048fefc969005",
      "translationZh": "在合理的医学可能性范围内，该椎间盘突出与2025年3月3日工作中的搬举事件存在因果关系。在该日期之前，索赔人没有任何有记录的腰部治疗史。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5a9a82a3fdf480f",
      "translationZh": "第1页，共52页 根据18份记录生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07c8c4224de74321",
      "translationZh": "唯一的输出是一份长达五十页的叙述性报告。要信任这份报告，医生就必须重新阅读整份病历，核查其中的每一项陈述，而这所花的时间可能与从头撰写报告一样长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b61df395e7283de5",
      "translationZh": "问题与其他例子相同，但风险更高。唯一的输出就是报告，而医生才是要为报告负责的人。要信任它，医生就必须重新查阅病历，亲自确认其中的事实和推断。这所花的时间可能与从头撰写报告一样长，也就违背了使用这一工具的初衷。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d366dff997550877",
      "translationZh": "你可能会提出异议：一份五十页的意见书很难核实。确实如此，产品不应该假装并非如此。可以说，帮助医生理解证据比提供一份完成的文档更有价值。因此，我建议创始人让产品像研究助理一样工作，而不是充当报告生成器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95bb35458da86695",
      "translationZh": "例如，产品可以阅读每一份记录并提取相关事实，同时附上指向原始页面的链接，让医生能够逐一核查。如果两次检查的结果不一致，或者病历中有某个问题尚无定论，产品就应该将其明确呈现出来。随后，医生可以解决这些矛盾并填补信息空白。最后，产品可以根据医生已经核查过的内容，汇编出最终报告。下面是一份示意草图，展示它可能的样子：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5397213c55775348",
      "translationZh": "文件 编辑 病例 审阅 报告 帮助",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7757588e8984a55e",
      "translationZh": "物理治疗记录 ✓",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1770b4c76686b8ef",
      "translationZh": "主治医师记录右侧直腿抬高试验为阳性（第 31 页），而此前的独立医学评估（IME）记录为阴性（第 22 页）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "497437f22ac2cb01",
      "translationZh": "初诊登记表记载，患者在 2019 年曾有腰部拉伤，这与因果关系的判定有关（第 14 页）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9526eb512bdffaf9",
      "translationZh": "档案中未见 March 18, 2025 之后的影像资料，因此目前椎间盘突出的状况尚未得到确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec255687b3a2a54b",
      "translationZh": "MRI 报告描述了 L4-L5 节段原已存在的退行性改变（第 9 页）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e74b52648f064c80",
      "translationZh": "24 项发现中仍有 6 项需要审核 生成报告草稿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2bb63b812eda482",
      "translationZh": "该产品首先引导医生逐一查看证据，呈现每项发现，并附上返回病历相应位置的链接。之后，再根据医生审核过的事实生成最终报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c008ab5f6b3a21ab",
      "translationZh": "这款产品的研究助理版本让医生能够在使用过程中逐步核实事实，从而建立信任。与其他示例类似，这种设计更容易构建和评估。现在有了范围明确、可供评分的单元，例如某处矛盾是否确实存在，或某条引用是否支持某项主张。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bd5fadff0aab1a15",
      "translationZh": "推广这一模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "330d6968eee75d90",
      "translationZh": "了解用户如何核验你产品中的 AI 产出非常重要。有时，这可能需要汇集佐证材料。在其他情况下，则可能意味着重构整个工作流程，让用户参与其中（就像工伤赔偿的例子那样）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c70251486b128498",
      "translationZh": "以下问题可以指导你在产品设计中支持核验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5201c25cc309e240",
      "translationZh": "用户实际上需要检查什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab03477c0df2e06b",
      "translationZh": "他们可以将其与什么可信的事物进行比较？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3995055e32d2178b",
      "translationZh": "专家是否会使用某些信号或启发式方法来辅助核验？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d85f51fbaa38923a",
      "translationZh": "可以将内容拆分成哪些更小的单元，供他们接受、编辑或拒绝？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfe0810e83e6e644",
      "translationZh": "贯穿这些例子的一个共同点是来源可追溯性。让输出便于核查的最快方法，是展示每个部分的来源，并提供链接以便查看更多细节。此外，你还可以采用渐进式披露，避免这些来源信息让用户不堪重负。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aca1b5dbd332044c",
      "translationZh": "随着用户信任的增长，需要核验的内容也会发生变化。起初，数据智能体应清楚地展示来源，例如某个指标定义来自哪里。一旦用户相信智能体能够正确处理，这些细节就可以在卡片中默认折叠。好的设计会适应用户当前的需求，而不是把所有内容都展示出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9c0e3dfaa8cc851",
      "translationZh": "即使一个产品看起来很容易评估，这些原则也同样适用。编程就是一个很好的例子：它有测试、类型和差异对比，是最容易验证的工作之一。即便如此，一些编程智能体仍会更进一步，让自己的工作成果更便于核查。Cursor 和 Devin 都会录制一段短视频，展示它们对 UI 所做的更改，这样你无需亲自复现，就能确认工作是否正确。5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad05779de62bff3c",
      "translationZh": "评估思维与良好的产品设计是一致的。收集支撑性数据，并将工作流程拆分成更小的单元，可以让自动评分更容易。不过，我不想装作这里的任何见解是什么新东西。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d886a4d21c4932b",
      "translationZh": "所有这些想法都源于成熟的设计原则。例如，在动手构建之前，观察专家如何工作，了解他们会检查什么，这就叫作需求发现。6 在医疗案例这类研究密集型工作中，有一个设计目标叫作意义建构，也就是对一组证据建立结构化的理解，以便据此进行推理。7 还有许多其他概念，不过我想你已经明白我的意思了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efe7d6bb425d522a",
      "translationZh": "尽管这些理念早已成熟，但在 AI 时代，仍有必要再次提醒大家。在 AI 出现之前，验证往往是在产出工作成果的过程中顺带完成的。有了 AI，验证成了瓶颈。是时候更明确地思考这件事了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba92ef736121bd60",
      "translationZh": "我录制了一段短视频，逐一讲解这些例子。如果你更愿意看视频而不是读文字，视频就在这里：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fe01a717228b84e",
      "translationZh": "感谢 Shreya Shankar 和 Isaac Flath 对本文提出反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f75b650bfabc3b88",
      "translationZh": "AI 评估专题中心汇集了我其余的评估相关工作。我还与他人共同教授 AI Evals for Engineers and PMs 这门课程。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2afff84513720768",
      "translationZh": "Lenny Rachitsky 最近在推文中谈到了这一点：某个数据科学团队现在的大部分工作，都是审查产品经理和工程师提交的半成品 AI 分析，其中有一半是错的。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87a6fc25575f9b2f",
      "translationZh": "我在 Airbnb 工作时，我们有一个叫 Knowledge Repo 的内部工具，数据科学家会在这里发布笔记本，记录他们对分析、建模等方面的深入探索（他们曾在这里撰文介绍过它）。这是了解新项目背景最快的方式之一，因为你可以阅读别人已经研究清楚的内容。我不知道它现在是否还在使用，但这种模式很好。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9848679968072000",
      "translationZh": "Bryan Bischof 主导了 Hex 的 AI 功能开发。Bryan 本人就是一位数据科学家，正是这款产品所服务的那类领域专家，我认为这也是它设计得好的部分原因。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffb103b72afcd975",
      "translationZh": "请参阅 Cursor 录制其 UI 更改过程的演示，以及 Devin 关于测试和录制的文档。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34dc68d813a0e212",
      "translationZh": "Dev Patnaik 和 Robert Becker，《需求探寻：为什么以及如何发现人们的需求》，《设计管理期刊》。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34a6206362c141fd",
      "translationZh": "Daniel M. Russell、Mark J. Stefik、Peter Pirolli 和 Stuart K. Card，《意义建构的成本结构》。↩︎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
